{"id":"n2-025","title":"A。要するに B。","romaji":"A. Yousuru ni B.","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Expressing 'in short', 'in a nutshell', or 'to sum up' when restating or summarizing A as B.","longExplanation":"The A。要するに B。grammar point is used to restate or summarize the information provided in A more concisely as B. It can be translated as 'in short', 'in a nutshell', or 'to sum up' in English. The formation consists of two sentences or statements, A and B, with 要するに (yousuru ni) in between to indicate the summary or restatement of A as B.","formation":"A。要するに B。","examples":[{"jp":"このプロジェクトは成功しました。要するに、私たちのチームは素晴らしい仕事をしました。","romaji":"Kono purojekuto wa seikou shimashita. Yousuru ni, watashitachi no chiimu wa subarashii shigoto o shimashita.","en":"This project was successful. In short, our team did a great job.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プロジェクト","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"要するに","vocabId":"1546620","reading":"ようするに"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"たち","vocabId":"1416220","reading":"たち"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"チーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"素晴らしい","vocabId":"1397300","reading":"すばらしい"},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[8]},{"jp":"彼は料理が上手です。要するに、彼は優れたシェフです。","romaji":"Kare wa ryouri ga jouzu desu. Yousuru ni, kare wa sugureta shefu desu.","en":"He is good at cooking. In a nutshell, he is an excellent chef.","words":[{"surf